    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Madrid is falling apart, and its inhabitants\u2014furious rats\u2014are just trying to survive in this hostile city. Explore its decaying streets, overcome urban obstacles, and leave your mark in the most irreverent way possible: by pooping all over it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mad Rats</strong> is a first-person exploration platformer set in a stylized version of Madrid. As a rat citizen, your goal is to discover all the hidden corners and high spots around the city to defecate on as an act of rebellion.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person 3D platforming </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real Madrid locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals with a grungy, low-poly aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling through graffiti, trash, and comically absurd dialogue with the city's rat inhabitants</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Madrid is falling apart, and its inhabitants\u2014furious rats\u2014are just trying to survive in this hostile city. Explore its decaying streets, overcome urban obstacles, and leave your mark in the most irreverent way possible: by pooping all over it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mad Rats</strong> is a first-person exploration platformer set in a stylized version of Madrid. As a rat citizen, your goal is to discover all the hidden corners and high spots around the city to defecate on as an act of rebellion.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person 3D platforming </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real Madrid locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals with a grungy, low-poly aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling through graffiti, trash, and comically absurd dialogue with the city's rat inhabitants</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "First-person platformer where you're a rat exploring a decaying version of Madrid. The city is falling apart, and the rats are furious. Jump, explore, and leave your mark on this hostile city... by pooping all over it.",
